cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WHISPER-CBPF in your research, please cite it."
title: "WHISPER-CBPF: Bayesian model comparison of transient light curves"
abstract: >-
  WHISPER-CBPF is an open-source, extensible Python toolkit for Bayesian model comparison of
  astronomical transient light curves: load photometry, fit candidate models with pluggable
  samplers (ABC, ABC-SMC, MCMC, nested sampling, NUTS and SNPE, on CPU or GPU), and obtain
  posteriors plus model-selection metrics (AIC, BIC, WAIC, PSIS-LOO).
type: software
authors:
